shot    corewar
size    24 80
cap     Core War: two battle programs written in Redcode, the warriors bomb.rc,
cap     dwarf.rc, gemini.rc and the rest, fight for control of a circular
cap     memory.  `corewar <cycles> a.e b.e' runs the fight; the screen maps the
cap     core, a 1 or a 2 marking the cells each program holds, with the cycles
cap     counting down.  Assemble a warrior with cwasm (cwasm dwarf.rc makes
cap     dwarf.e); twelve samples and their objects are in GAMES/COREWARS.
