run     hanoimod 3 | head -n 20
wait    2

shot    knight
size    24 80
cap     A tour begun at A1 and three moves on: every square visited is marked
cap     ***, and the arrows point at the knight's row and column.
try     knight
run     clear
wait    1
run     knight
wait    6
send    n
wait    3
send    s
wait    2
send    a
wait    1
send    1
wait    2
send    b
wait    1
send    3
wait    2
send    c
wait    1
send    1
wait    2
send    e
wait    1
send    2
wait    3
snap

shot    bks
size    24 80
cap     Bricks drop into the pit on the left and pile up at the bottom; the
cap     paddle, ====, is there to catch them.  The menu beside it lists the keys.
try     bks
run     clear
wait    1
run     bks
wait    5
send    p
wait    3
send    ,
wait    1
send    ,
wait    8

shot    sol
size    24 80
cap     A fresh deal: the seven runs, the ace piles and the deck at the right,
cap     and the deck thumbed once.  Commands go in at the cmd prompt.
try     sol
run     clear
wait    1
run     sol
wait    6
send    t\r
wait    3
snap

shot    solx
size    24 80
cap     A solx deal: no deck, every card in a run, and the layout turned on
cap     its side so a run can grow long.  Runs split where you say.
try     solx
run     clear
wait    1
run     solx
wait    6
snap

shot    jumble2
size    24 80
cap     A round of one word at the simplest level: the scrambled word, the time
cap     allowed for it, and the prompt for a guess.
try     jumble2
run     clear
wait    1
run     jumble2
wait    4
send    n\r
wait    2
send    s\r
wait    2
send    1\r
wait    8
snap

shot    perp
size    24 80
cap     The first screen a few steps in: the player, the boulders and keys, and
cap     the panel counting diamonds and boulders left, score, level and moves.
try     perp
run     clear
wait    1
run     perp
wait    6
send    llll
wait    3
send    jjjj
wait    4
snap

shot    torus
size    24 80
cap     A new level: you are the @, robots are + and the fast ones #.  Each
cap     move you make, every robot steps toward you.
try     torus
run     clear
wait    1
run     torus
wait    6
send    .
wait    3
snap

shot    vcraps
size    24 80
cap     A $10 bet on the pass line, then r rolls the dice.
try     vcraps
run     clear
wait    1
run     vcraps
wait    4
send    \s
wait    1
send    \s
wait    1
send    \s
wait    2
send    p
wait    1
send    10\r
wait    2
send    r
wait    6
snap

shot    trek73
size    24 80
cap     A battle opens after three answers: the captain's name, a sex and
cap     one enemy vessel.  Code [1-32] waits for a command.
try     trek73
run     clear
wait    1
run     trek73
wait    4
send    Kirk\r
wait    2
send    m\r
wait    2
send    1\r
wait    6
snap

shot    ski
size    24 80
cap     A run down the slope, one row a turn: you are the I, trees are Y, and
cap     the ? waits for a letter -- here R, then L -- or Return.
try     ski
run     clear
wait    1
run     ski
wait    4
send    \r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    R\r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    L\r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    1
send    \r
wait    2
snap

shot    wf
size    30 80
cap     A 12 by 12 square from the post's word file, with its title and the
cap     list of the words it hid.
try     wf -x 12 -y 12 -t Words
run     builtin cd /dd/DOC/wf
wait    1
run     clear
wait    1
run     wf -x 12 -y 12 -t Words
wait    5

shot    bugs
size    24 80
cap     Level 0: a two-letter piece falls into the bottle of bugs, and four
cap     letters alike in a row, across or down, clear them.
try     bugs
run     clear
wait    1
run     bugs
wait    4
send    \r
wait    2
send    \r
wait    5
snap

shot    letters
size    24 80
cap     Words falling toward the bottom of the screen, with the score, level,
cap     words, lives and typing speed on the last line.
try     letters
run     clear
wait    1
run     letters
wait    6
snap

shot    kalah
size    30 80
cap     A Kalah game at skill 2: the opening move from bin 3, the computer's
cap     reply, and its advice for the next move.
try     kalah
run     clear
wait    1
run     kalah
wait    3
send    k\r
wait    1
send    2\r
wait    1
send    1\r
wait    2
send    3\r
wait    4
send    -2\r
wait    4
snap

shot    yidslots
size    24 80
cap     Three windows spinning through parts of names.  A bet of five is
cap     placed, the windows stop, and the combination is judged.
try     yidslots
run     clear
wait    1
run     yidslots
wait    5
send    5\r
wait    7
snap
